[?2004l--- Page 1 ---
Abundant Cloud Platform — Pricing Addendum
Effective: January 1, 2026
Usage Pricing Tiers
Each account includes 100,000 API calls per calendar month at no additional charge.
Tier 1 Overage: calls 100,001 through 200,000 are billed at USD 0.002 per call.
Tier 2 Overage: calls above 200,000 are billed at USD 0.0015 per call.
Billable overage is rounded UP to the nearest 1,000 calls before rate application.
Enterprise Legacy Discount
Accounts designated as Enterprise Legacy in the customer registry receive an 8%
discount applied to total overage charges. The discount is applied after tier rate
calculation and before any tax. Discount applies to all overage tiers.
Tax Policy
Sales tax and VAT are excluded from usage overage charges in billing reconciliation
audits. Where tax appears on an invoice overage line, it must be separated and
classified as line_type='tax' in the extracted invoice lines.
Regional Currency Policy
EMEA accounts are invoiced in EUR. Billing reconciliation is performed in USD
using the monthly usd_rate from fx_rates.csv for the service month.
Legacy Billing Adjustments
Account-months listed in legacy_call_adjustments.xlsx carry authoritative call-count
values from the prior billing system. Interpret those cells using standard Excel
formula semantics.
Dispute Severity Framework
High — sales tax or VAT included in usage overage charges.
Medium — Enterprise Legacy discount not applied to invoice overage, tier
arithmetic errors, or rounding errors.
Low — immaterial per-call rate variance below the audit materiality threshold.
Base Plan
Base plan subscription charges are USD 500.00 per account per month.
Base plan lines are not subject to dispute review in this audit.
